    user_response: "make me a landing page for hvac company using the code im going to paste make it similar as the one in the photo attached and ensure it is fully responsive on all mobile devices and in the web im gonna paste the code in the Go high level and incorporates a contact form, testimonials section, and a clear call-to-action button. here is the code: \n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Apex Air Solutions | Reliable HVAC Repair & Installation</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --primary: #0284c7;\n      --primary-dark: #0369a1;\n      --accent: #f97316;\n      --accent-hover: #ea580c;\n      --dark: #0f172a;\n      --gray-light: #f8fafc;\n      --gray-border: #e2e8f0;\n      --text-muted: #64748b;\n      --text-main: #1e293b;\n      --success: #16a34a;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n      max-width: 1120px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    /* Top Bar */\n    .top-bar {\n      background: var(--dark);\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 10px 0;\n      font-size: 0.875rem;\n    }\n    .top-bar .container {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .badge-urgent {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    /* Navbar */\n    header {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      z-index: 50;\n    }\n    nav {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 16px 0;\n    }\n    .logo {\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      text-decoration: none;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .logo span {\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n    .nav-cta {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    .phone-link {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Buttons */\n    .btn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 12px 24px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      border: none;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      text-align: center;\n      transition: all 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .btn-primary {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n    .btn-primary:hover {\n      background: var(--accent-hover);\n    }\n    .btn-outline {\n      border: 1px solid var(--primary);\n      color: var(--primary);\n      background: transparent;\n    }\n    .btn-outline:hover {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    /* Hero Section */\n    .hero {\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f0f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%);\n      padding: 60px 0 40px;\n    }\n    .hero-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;\n      gap: 40px;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .hero-content h1 {\n      font-size: 2.75rem;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    .hero-content p {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .features-checklist {\n      list-style: none;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .features-checklist li {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n    .check-icon {\n      color: var(--success);\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    /* Form Card */\n    .form-card {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 28px;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n    }\n    .form-header {\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    .form-header h3 {\n      font-size: 1.3rem;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .form-header p {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .form-group {\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n    .form-group label {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    .form-control {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    .form-control:focus {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    /* Trust Stats */\n    .trust-bar {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      background: var(--gray-light);\n      padding: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .stats-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      text-align: center;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .stat-item h4 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    .stat-item p {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    /* Sections Shared */\n    .section {\n      padding: 60px 0;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 0 auto 40px;\n    }\n    .section-title h2 {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .section-title p {\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Digital Coupons */\n    .coupon-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .coupon-card {\n      border: 2px dashed var(--primary);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: #f0fdf4;\n      padding: 24px;\n      position: relative;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .coupon-tag {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -12px;\n      right: 16px;\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      padding: 2px 10px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n    .coupon-price {\n      margin: 14px 0;\n    }\n    .price-strike {\n      text-decoration: line-through;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-right: 8px;\n    }\n    .price-promo {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .coupon-code-box {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      padding: 6px 12px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-family: monospace;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    /* System Reliability */\n    .reliability-bg {\n      background: var(--gray-light);\n    }\n    .grid-3 {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      padding: 28px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n    }\n    .card-icon {\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    .card h3 {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .card p {\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Transparent Pricing */\n    .pricing-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .pricing-card {\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 30px 24px;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: #fff;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pricing-card.featured {\n      border: 2px solid var(--primary);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);\n    }\n    .pricing-featured-tag {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -12px;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 2px 12px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .pricing-tier {\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .pricing-amount {\n      font-size: 2.2rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      margin: 16px 0;\n    }\n    .pricing-features {\n      list-style: none;\n      text-align: left;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n    }\n    .pricing-features li {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    /* Footer */\n    footer {\n      background: var(--dark);\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      padding: 40px 0 20px;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n    }\n    .footer-content {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;\n      padding-bottom: 24px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .footer-logo {\n      color: #fff;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Responsive */\n    @media (max-width: 900px) {\n      .hero-grid,\n      .coupon-grid,\n      .grid-3,\n      .pricing-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n      .stats-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      }\n      .hero-content h1 {\n        font-size: 2.1rem;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Urgent Top Bar -->\n  <div class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div><span class=\"badge-urgent\">Live Dispatch</span> Technicians available in your area today.</div>\n      <div>Emergency 24/7 Service: <strong>(555) 019-2834</strong></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <nav>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">\342\235\204\357\270\217 Apex<span>Air</span></a>\n        <div class=\"nav-cta\">\n          <a href=\"tel:5550192834\" class=\"phone-link\">\360\237\223\236 (555) 019-2834</a>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book Online</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Hero Section with Form -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n          <h1>Reliable Home Comfort When You Need It Most.</h1>\n          <p>Fast, same-day HVAC repair, precision tune-ups, and energy-efficient system replacements. Upfront pricing with zero hidden overtime fees.</p>\n          <ul class=\"features-checklist\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Same-Day Local Dispatch</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 100% Upfront Quotes</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> EPA-Certified Techs</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 1-Year Workmanship Warranty</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"form-card\" id=\"book\">\n          <div class=\"form-header\">\n            <h3>Claim Voucher & Book Service</h3>\n            <p>Get a confirmed dispatch window in under 2 minutes.</p>\n          </div>\n          <form onsubmit=\"handleFormSubmit(event)\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Full Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" required class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"John Doe\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Phone Number</label>\n              <input type=\"tel\" required class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"(555) 000-0000\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Service Needed</label>\n              <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"service-select\">\n                <option value=\"repair\">Emergency AC / Heater Repair</option>\n                <option value=\"tuneup\">21-Point System Tune-Up</option>\n                <option value=\"install\">Complete System Replacement</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Promo Code Applied</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"promo-input\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"SUMMER50\" readonly style=\"background:#f1f5f9; font-weight:bold; color:var(--primary);\" />\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Redeem Coupon & Book Now</button>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.75rem; text-align:center; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:8px;\">\360\237\224\222 No payment required until the job is complete.</p>\n          </form>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Trust Bar -->\n  <div class=\"trust-bar\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>4.9 / 5.0</h4>\n          <p>350+ Google Reviews</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>45 Mins</h4>\n          <p>Avg. Response Time</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>100%</h4>\n          <p>Fixed-Right Guarantee</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>#HVAC-98231</h4>\n          <p>Fully Licensed & Insured</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Digital Coupons -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <h2>Seasonal Discounts & Promos</h2>\n        <p>Click any coupon below to automatically apply the voucher to your service call.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"coupon-grid\">\n        <div class=\"coupon-card\">\n          <span class=\"coupon-tag\">Most Popular</span>\n          <h3>Diagnostic Call</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Full system check and exact written repair estimate.</p>\n          <div class=\"coupon-price\">\n            <span class=\"price-strike\">$129</span>\n            <span class=\"price-promo\">$79</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"coupon-code-box\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SUMMER50\')\">CODE: SUMMER50</div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SUMMER50\')\">Apply to Booking</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"coupon-card\">\n          <span class=\"coupon-tag\">Preventative</span>\n          <h3>21-Point Tune-Up</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Deep coil cleaning, electrical checks, and airflow calibration.</p>\n          <div class=\"coupon-price\">\n            <span class=\"price-strike\">$189</span>\n            <span class=\"price-promo\">$99</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"coupon-code-box\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'TUNE21\')\">CODE: TUNE21</div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'TUNE21\')\">Apply to Booking</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"coupon-card\">\n          <span class=\"coupon-tag\">Big Savings</span>\n          <h3>Full System Install</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Complete heat pump or high-efficiency central AC replacement.</p>\n          <div class=\"coupon-price\">\n            <span class=\"price-promo\">$500 OFF</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"coupon-code-box\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SYSTEM500\')\">CODE: SYSTEM500</div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SYSTEM500\')\">Apply to Booking</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Reliability / How We Build Long-Lasting Systems -->\n  <section class=\"section reliability-bg\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <h2>Why Our Systems Stay Reliable</h2>\n        <p>Most HVAC breakdowns stem from poor initial sizing and improper airflow. Here is how we make sure your system runs smooth for 15+ years.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid-3\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">\360\237\223\220</div>\n          <h3>Exact Load Calculation</h3>\n          <p>We measure your home\'s square footage, insulation levels, and window placements to prevent short-cycling and cut electricity waste.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">\360\237\222\250</div>\n          <h3>Static Pressure Balancing</h3>\n          <p>Properly calibrated duct pressure prevents extra strain on blower motors and stops compressors from burning out prematurely.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">\360\237\233\241\357\270\217</div>\n          <h3>1-Year Fixed-Right Warranty</h3>\n          <p>If any repair fails within 12 months, our technician returns and fixes the issue at zero extra charge to you.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Transparent Pricing Section -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <h2>100% Transparent Pricing</h2>\n        <p>No unexpected bills. You approve the exact cost before work begins.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pricing-grid\">\n        <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n          <div class=\"pricing-tier\">Diagnostic & Inspection</div>\n          <div class=\"pricing-amount\">$79 <span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: var(--text-muted);\">flat</span></div>\n          <ul class=\"pricing-features\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Complete system troubleshooting</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Upfront itemized quote</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Waived if you approve repair</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Select Diagnostic</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pricing-card featured\">\n          <span class=\"pricing-featured-tag\">Best Value</span>\n          <div class=\"pricing-tier\">Seasonal Precision Tune-Up</div>\n          <div class=\"pricing-amount\">$99 <span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: var(--text-muted);\">flat</span></div>\n          <ul class=\"pricing-features\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 21-point safety inspection</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Refrigerant level verification</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Condensate line drain clear</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Electrical contact cleaning</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Select Tune-Up</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n          <div class=\"pricing-tier\">Comfort Club Membership</div>\n          <div class=\"pricing-amount\">$19 <span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: var(--text-muted);\">/month</span></div>\n          <ul class=\"pricing-features\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 2 Full tune-ups per year</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 15% discount on all repairs</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Priority emergency dispatch</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Join Comfort Club</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-content\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"footer-logo\">Apex Air Solutions</div>\n          <p style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">Licensed, Bonded, and Insured HVAC Contractors</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p><strong>Dispatch:</strong> (555) 019-2834</p>\n          <p><strong>Email:</strong> dispatch@apexair.com</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"text-align: center;\">&copy; 2026 Apex Air Solutions. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    function applyCoupon(code) {\n      document.getElementById(\'promo-input\').value = code;\n      const select = document.getElementById(\'service-select\');\n      if (code === \'TUNE21\') select.value = \'tuneup\';\n      if (code === \'SUMMER50\') select.value = \'repair\';\n      if (code === \'SYSTEM500\') select.value = \'install\';\n\n      document.getElementById(\'book\').scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\n    }\n\n    function handleFormSubmit(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      alert(\'Booking request received! Our automated dispatch system is sending your confirmation SMS.\');\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    items {
      text: "make me a landing page for hvac company using the code im going to paste make it similar as the one in the photo attached and ensure it is fully responsive on all mobile devices and in the web im gonna paste the code in the Go high level and incorporates a contact form, testimonials section, and a clear call-to-action button. here is the code: \n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Apex Air Solutions | Reliable HVAC Repair & Installation</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --primary: #0284c7;\n      --primary-dark: #0369a1;\n      --accent: #f97316;\n      --accent-hover: #ea580c;\n      --dark: #0f172a;\n      --gray-light: #f8fafc;\n      --gray-border: #e2e8f0;\n      --text-muted: #64748b;\n      --text-main: #1e293b;\n      --success: #16a34a;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n      max-width: 1120px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    /* Top Bar */\n    .top-bar {\n      background: var(--dark);\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 10px 0;\n      font-size: 0.875rem;\n    }\n    .top-bar .container {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .badge-urgent {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    /* Navbar */\n    header {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      z-index: 50;\n    }\n    nav {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 16px 0;\n    }\n    .logo {\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      text-decoration: none;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .logo span {\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n    .nav-cta {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    .phone-link {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Buttons */\n    .btn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 12px 24px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      border: none;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      text-align: center;\n      transition: all 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .btn-primary {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n    .btn-primary:hover {\n      background: var(--accent-hover);\n    }\n    .btn-outline {\n      border: 1px solid var(--primary);\n      color: var(--primary);\n      background: transparent;\n    }\n    .btn-outline:hover {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    /* Hero Section */\n    .hero {\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f0f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%);\n      padding: 60px 0 40px;\n    }\n    .hero-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;\n      gap: 40px;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .hero-content h1 {\n      font-size: 2.75rem;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    .hero-content p {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .features-checklist {\n      list-style: none;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .features-checklist li {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n    .check-icon {\n      color: var(--success);\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    /* Form Card */\n    .form-card {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 28px;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n    }\n    .form-header {\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    .form-header h3 {\n      font-size: 1.3rem;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .form-header p {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .form-group {\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n    .form-group label {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    .form-control {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    .form-control:focus {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    /* Trust Stats */\n    .trust-bar {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      background: var(--gray-light);\n      padding: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .stats-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      text-align: center;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .stat-item h4 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    .stat-item p {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    /* Sections Shared */\n    .section {\n      padding: 60px 0;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 0 auto 40px;\n    }\n    .section-title h2 {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .section-title p {\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Digital Coupons */\n    .coupon-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .coupon-card {\n      border: 2px dashed var(--primary);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: #f0fdf4;\n      padding: 24px;\n      position: relative;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .coupon-tag {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -12px;\n      right: 16px;\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      padding: 2px 10px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n    .coupon-price {\n      margin: 14px 0;\n    }\n    .price-strike {\n      text-decoration: line-through;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-right: 8px;\n    }\n    .price-promo {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .coupon-code-box {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      padding: 6px 12px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-family: monospace;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    /* System Reliability */\n    .reliability-bg {\n      background: var(--gray-light);\n    }\n    .grid-3 {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      padding: 28px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n    }\n    .card-icon {\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    .card h3 {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .card p {\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Transparent Pricing */\n    .pricing-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .pricing-card {\n      border: 1px solid var(--gray-border);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 30px 24px;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: #fff;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pricing-card.featured {\n      border: 2px solid var(--primary);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);\n    }\n    .pricing-featured-tag {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -12px;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 2px 12px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .pricing-tier {\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--dark);\n    }\n    .pricing-amount {\n      font-size: 2.2rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--dark);\n      margin: 16px 0;\n    }\n    .pricing-features {\n      list-style: none;\n      text-align: left;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n    }\n    .pricing-features li {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    /* Footer */\n    footer {\n      background: var(--dark);\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      padding: 40px 0 20px;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n    }\n    .footer-content {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;\n      padding-bottom: 24px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .footer-logo {\n      color: #fff;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Responsive */\n    @media (max-width: 900px) {\n      .hero-grid,\n      .coupon-grid,\n      .grid-3,\n      .pricing-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n      .stats-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      }\n      .hero-content h1 {\n        font-size: 2.1rem;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Urgent Top Bar -->\n  <div class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div><span class=\"badge-urgent\">Live Dispatch</span> Technicians available in your area today.</div>\n      <div>Emergency 24/7 Service: <strong>(555) 019-2834</strong></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <nav>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">\342\235\204\357\270\217 Apex<span>Air</span></a>\n        <div class=\"nav-cta\">\n          <a href=\"tel:5550192834\" class=\"phone-link\">\360\237\223\236 (555) 019-2834</a>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book Online</a>\n        </div>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Hero Section with Form -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n          <h1>Reliable Home Comfort When You Need It Most.</h1>\n          <p>Fast, same-day HVAC repair, precision tune-ups, and energy-efficient system replacements. Upfront pricing with zero hidden overtime fees.</p>\n          <ul class=\"features-checklist\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Same-Day Local Dispatch</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 100% Upfront Quotes</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> EPA-Certified Techs</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 1-Year Workmanship Warranty</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"form-card\" id=\"book\">\n          <div class=\"form-header\">\n            <h3>Claim Voucher & Book Service</h3>\n            <p>Get a confirmed dispatch window in under 2 minutes.</p>\n          </div>\n          <form onsubmit=\"handleFormSubmit(event)\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Full Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" required class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"John Doe\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Phone Number</label>\n              <input type=\"tel\" required class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"(555) 000-0000\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Service Needed</label>\n              <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"service-select\">\n                <option value=\"repair\">Emergency AC / Heater Repair</option>\n                <option value=\"tuneup\">21-Point System Tune-Up</option>\n                <option value=\"install\">Complete System Replacement</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>Promo Code Applied</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"promo-input\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"SUMMER50\" readonly style=\"background:#f1f5f9; font-weight:bold; color:var(--primary);\" />\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Redeem Coupon & Book Now</button>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.75rem; text-align:center; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:8px;\">\360\237\224\222 No payment required until the job is complete.</p>\n          </form>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Trust Bar -->\n  <div class=\"trust-bar\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>4.9 / 5.0</h4>\n          <p>350+ Google Reviews</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>45 Mins</h4>\n          <p>Avg. Response Time</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>100%</h4>\n          <p>Fixed-Right Guarantee</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <h4>#HVAC-98231</h4>\n          <p>Fully Licensed & Insured</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Digital Coupons -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <h2>Seasonal Discounts & Promos</h2>\n        <p>Click any coupon below to automatically apply the voucher to your service call.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"coupon-grid\">\n        <div class=\"coupon-card\">\n          <span class=\"coupon-tag\">Most Popular</span>\n          <h3>Diagnostic Call</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Full system check and exact written repair estimate.</p>\n          <div class=\"coupon-price\">\n            <span class=\"price-strike\">$129</span>\n            <span class=\"price-promo\">$79</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"coupon-code-box\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SUMMER50\')\">CODE: SUMMER50</div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SUMMER50\')\">Apply to Booking</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"coupon-card\">\n          <span class=\"coupon-tag\">Preventative</span>\n          <h3>21-Point Tune-Up</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Deep coil cleaning, electrical checks, and airflow calibration.</p>\n          <div class=\"coupon-price\">\n            <span class=\"price-strike\">$189</span>\n            <span class=\"price-promo\">$99</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"coupon-code-box\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'TUNE21\')\">CODE: TUNE21</div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'TUNE21\')\">Apply to Booking</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"coupon-card\">\n          <span class=\"coupon-tag\">Big Savings</span>\n          <h3>Full System Install</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">Complete heat pump or high-efficiency central AC replacement.</p>\n          <div class=\"coupon-price\">\n            <span class=\"price-promo\">$500 OFF</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"coupon-code-box\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SYSTEM500\')\">CODE: SYSTEM500</div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"applyCoupon(\'SYSTEM500\')\">Apply to Booking</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Reliability / How We Build Long-Lasting Systems -->\n  <section class=\"section reliability-bg\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <h2>Why Our Systems Stay Reliable</h2>\n        <p>Most HVAC breakdowns stem from poor initial sizing and improper airflow. Here is how we make sure your system runs smooth for 15+ years.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid-3\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">\360\237\223\220</div>\n          <h3>Exact Load Calculation</h3>\n          <p>We measure your home\'s square footage, insulation levels, and window placements to prevent short-cycling and cut electricity waste.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">\360\237\222\250</div>\n          <h3>Static Pressure Balancing</h3>\n          <p>Properly calibrated duct pressure prevents extra strain on blower motors and stops compressors from burning out prematurely.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-icon\">\360\237\233\241\357\270\217</div>\n          <h3>1-Year Fixed-Right Warranty</h3>\n          <p>If any repair fails within 12 months, our technician returns and fixes the issue at zero extra charge to you.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Transparent Pricing Section -->\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <h2>100% Transparent Pricing</h2>\n        <p>No unexpected bills. You approve the exact cost before work begins.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pricing-grid\">\n        <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n          <div class=\"pricing-tier\">Diagnostic & Inspection</div>\n          <div class=\"pricing-amount\">$79 <span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: var(--text-muted);\">flat</span></div>\n          <ul class=\"pricing-features\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Complete system troubleshooting</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Upfront itemized quote</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Waived if you approve repair</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Select Diagnostic</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pricing-card featured\">\n          <span class=\"pricing-featured-tag\">Best Value</span>\n          <div class=\"pricing-tier\">Seasonal Precision Tune-Up</div>\n          <div class=\"pricing-amount\">$99 <span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: var(--text-muted);\">flat</span></div>\n          <ul class=\"pricing-features\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 21-point safety inspection</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Refrigerant level verification</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Condensate line drain clear</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Electrical contact cleaning</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Select Tune-Up</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n          <div class=\"pricing-tier\">Comfort Club Membership</div>\n          <div class=\"pricing-amount\">$19 <span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: var(--text-muted);\">/month</span></div>\n          <ul class=\"pricing-features\">\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 2 Full tune-ups per year</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> 15% discount on all repairs</li>\n            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">\342\234\224</span> Priority emergency dispatch</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#book\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Join Comfort Club</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-content\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"footer-logo\">Apex Air Solutions</div>\n          <p style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">Licensed, Bonded, and Insured HVAC Contractors</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p><strong>Dispatch:</strong> (555) 019-2834</p>\n          <p><strong>Email:</strong> dispatch@apexair.com</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"text-align: center;\">&copy; 2026 Apex Air Solutions. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    function applyCoupon(code) {\n      document.getElementById(\'promo-input\').value = code;\n      const select = document.getElementById(\'service-select\');\n      if (code === \'TUNE21\') select.value = \'tuneup\';\n      if (code === \'SUMMER50\') select.value = \'repair\';\n      if (code === \'SYSTEM500\') select.value = \'install\';\n\n      document.getElementById(\'book\').scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\n    }\n\n    function handleFormSubmit(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      alert(\'Booking request received! Our automated dispatch system is sending your confirmation SMS.\');\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
