        lines {
          text: "    fullDesc: \'Indoor air can be 2 to 5 times more polluted than outdoor air. Our air quality team installs whole-house HEPA filtration, UV-C germicidal lamps, and performs duct static pressure testing to eliminate leaks that waste up to 30% of your conditioned air.\',"
