  planner_response {
    response: "I have built a high-converting, fully responsive HVAC landing page for **Apex Air Solutions**, crafted to match the provided code and reference design.\n\n### Key Highlights & Features\n\n- **Hero & Promotional Offer**: Centered on the high-impact **\"Get $25 off on any service call\"** offer, accompanied by certified trust checkpoints (*Same-Day Local Dispatch*, *100% Upfront Quotes*, *EPA-Certified Techs*, and *1-Year Workmanship Warranty*), emergency 24/7 call buttons, and quick dispatch triggers.\n- **Interactive HVAC Troubleshooting System**: An interactive diagnostic wizard that lets homeowners select between AC and Heating symptoms (*blowing warm air, unit won\'t turn on, noises, frozen coils, ignition faults*) to receive an instant root-cause analysis and pre-apply repair vouchers.\n- **SEER Energy Savings Calculator**: A dynamic energy savings calculator with an interactive circular percentage gauge, 5-year dollar savings estimates, adjustable electricity rates (cents per kWh), AC tonnage selector, and current vs. new SEER steppers.\n- **\"Our Services\" Carousel & Detail Modals**: Features *AC Installation*, *AC Repair*, *AC Maintenance*, *Heating & Furnace Repair*, and *Indoor Air Quality & Duct Sealing* with cycling controls and informative **(Read More)** detail modals.\n- **Maintenance Plan Matrix**: A 12-benefit matrix highlighting the yearly maintenance agreement benefits (*saves money, maximizes airflow, safety checks, 15% repair discount*) with direct membership enrollment.\n- **Certifications & Social Proof**: Displays verified industry badges (*BBB A+ Accredited*, *NATE Certified*, *EPA Universal Section 608*, *Energy Star*, *Chamber of Commerce*), paired with a verified **Client Testimonial Carousel** and a **Rate Our Tech** review submission portal.\n- **Digital Coupons & Transparent Pricing**: Digital voucher cards (*SUMMER50*, *TUNE21*, *SYSTEM500*, *REBATE25*) with 1-click clipboard copying and automatic form injection, alongside upfront flat-rate pricing cards.\n- **Contact & Estimate Booking Form**: A complete form (*Name, Email, Phone, Service selection, Promo Code, Preferred window, and Comments*) with live validation, realistic stocked service van visuals, and payment badges (*Discover, Amex, Visa, MasterCard*).\n- **GoHighLevel (GHL) Ready Code Exporter**: Includes a dedicated **\"GoHighLevel HTML\"** modal (accessible from the header, footer, or floating tool) that generates the complete, self-contained standalone HTML5/CSS3/Vanilla JS template so you can copy and paste it directly into GoHighLevel funnels or custom code blocks."
    thinking: "**Verifying User Request**\n\nI\'ve confirmed that the build process, encompassing both linting and compilation, was successful. I am now thoroughly re-examining the user\'s initial instructions, focusing on every nuance. Specifically, I\'m verifying the requirements related to creating a landing page and the provided codebase. My priority is to meticulously match the request\'s core objectives.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built a high-converting, fully responsive HVAC landing page for **Apex Air Solutions**, crafted to match the provided code and reference design.\n\n### Key Highlights & Features\n\n- **Hero & Promotional Offer**: Centered on the high-impact **\"Get $25 off on any service call\"** offer, accompanied by certified trust checkpoints (*Same-Day Local Dispatch*, *100% Upfront Quotes*, *EPA-Certified Techs*, and *1-Year Workmanship Warranty*), emergency 24/7 call buttons, and quick dispatch triggers.\n- **Interactive HVAC Troubleshooting System**: An interactive diagnostic wizard that lets homeowners select between AC and Heating symptoms (*blowing warm air, unit won\'t turn on, noises, frozen coils, ignition faults*) to receive an instant root-cause analysis and pre-apply repair vouchers.\n- **SEER Energy Savings Calculator**: A dynamic energy savings calculator with an interactive circular percentage gauge, 5-year dollar savings estimates, adjustable electricity rates (cents per kWh), AC tonnage selector, and current vs. new SEER steppers.\n- **\"Our Services\" Carousel & Detail Modals**: Features *AC Installation*, *AC Repair*, *AC Maintenance*, *Heating & Furnace Repair*, and *Indoor Air Quality & Duct Sealing* with cycling controls and informative **(Read More)** detail modals.\n- **Maintenance Plan Matrix**: A 12-benefit matrix highlighting the yearly maintenance agreement benefits (*saves money, maximizes airflow, safety checks, 15% repair discount*) with direct membership enrollment.\n- **Certifications & Social Proof**: Displays verified industry badges (*BBB A+ Accredited*, *NATE Certified*, *EPA Universal Section 608*, *Energy Star*, *Chamber of Commerce*), paired with a verified **Client Testimonial Carousel** and a **Rate Our Tech** review submission portal.\n- **Digital Coupons & Transparent Pricing**: Digital voucher cards (*SUMMER50*, *TUNE21*, *SYSTEM500*, *REBATE25*) with 1-click clipboard copying and automatic form injection, alongside upfront flat-rate pricing cards.\n- **Contact & Estimate Booking Form**: A complete form (*Name, Email, Phone, Service selection, Promo Code, Preferred window, and Comments*) with live validation, realistic stocked service van visuals, and payment badges (*Discover, Amex, Visa, MasterCard*).\n- **GoHighLevel (GHL) Ready Code Exporter**: Includes a dedicated **\"GoHighLevel HTML\"** modal (accessible from the header, footer, or floating tool) that generates the complete, self-contained standalone HTML5/CSS3/Vanilla JS template so you can copy and paste it directly into GoHighLevel funnels or custom code blocks."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 497728201
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
