  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Bold Typography\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bold Typography\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-slate-50 flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden text-slate-900\'><div class=\'bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 py-2 px-10 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\'><div><span class=\'bg-orange-500 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm mr-2\'>Live Dispatch</span>Technicians available in your area today</div><div>24/7 Emergency Service: (555) 019-2834</div></div><header class=\'bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-5 px-10 flex justify-between items-center\'><div class=\'text-2xl font-black flex items-center gap-2\'>\342\235\204\357\270\217 APEX <span class=\'text-sky-600\'>AIR</span></div><div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'><a href=\'tel:5550192834\' class=\'text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\'>(555) 019-2834</a><button class=\'bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-md font-extrabold shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/20\'>BOOK ONLINE</button></div></header><main class=\'flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-10 px-10 py-8\'><div class=\'col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center\'><h1 class=\'text-[72px] leading-[0.9] font-black tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mb-6 uppercase italic\'>RELIABLE<br/>HOME<br/><span class=\'text-sky-600\'>COMFORT.</span></h1><p class=\'text-lg text-slate-500 max-w-lg mb-8 font-medium\'>Fast, same-day HVAC repair and precision tune-ups. Upfront pricing with zero hidden fees and a 1-year workmanship guarantee.</p><div class=\'grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8\'><div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-sm text-slate-700 bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\'><span class=\'text-green-500 text-xl\'>\342\234\224</span> Same-Day Local Dispatch</div><div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-sm text-slate-700 bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\'><span class=\'text-green-500 text-xl\'>\342\234\224</span> 100% Upfront Quotes</div><div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-sm text-slate-700 bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\'><span class=\'text-green-500 text-xl\'>\342\234\224</span> EPA-Certified Techs</div><div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 font-bold text-sm text-slate-700 bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\'><span class=\'text-green-500 text-xl\'>\342\234\224</span> 1-Year Warranty</div></div><div class=\'bg-sky-50 border-l-4 border-sky-600 p-5 rounded-r-xl\'><p class=\'italic text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed\'>\'Apex Air arrived within 45 minutes and fixed our AC before the kids got home. Truly life-savers during the heatwave!\'</p><p class=\'text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 text-sky-700\'>\342\200\224 Sarah Jenkins, Local Homeowner</p></div></div><div class=\'col-span-5 flex items-center\'><div class=\'bg-white w-full rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-orange-500\'></div><div class=\'mb-6\'><h3 class=\'text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight\'>Book Service</h3><p class=\'text-slate-500 text-sm\'>Redeem voucher <span class=\'font-bold text-sky-600\'>SUMMER50</span> for $50 OFF</p></div><form class=\'space-y-4\'><div class=\'space-y-1\'><label class=\'text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400\'>Full Name</label><input type=\'text\' placeholder=\'John Doe\' class=\'w-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 outline-none\'></div><div class=\'space-y-1\'><label class=\'text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400\'>Phone Number</label><input type=\'tel\' placeholder=\'(555) 000-0000\' class=\'w-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 outline-none\'></div><div class=\'space-y-1\'><label class=\'text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400\'>Service Needed</label><select class=\'w-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 outline-none\'><option>Emergency Repair</option><option>Seasonal Tune-Up</option><option>New System Quote</option></select></div><button type=\'submit\' class=\'w-full bg-slate-900 text-white py-4 rounded-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-lg\'>Redeem & Schedule</button><p class=\'text-[10px] text-center text-slate-400 mt-4\'>\360\237\224\222 NO PAYMENT REQUIRED UNTIL JOB COMPLETION</p></form></div></div></main><footer class=\'bg-slate-100 border-t border-slate-200 py-6 px-10 flex justify-between items-center\'><div class=\'flex gap-10\'><div class=\'text-center\'><div class=\'text-xl font-black text-sky-600\'>4.9/5.0</div><div class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500 tracking-tighter\'>Google Rating</div></div><div class=\'text-center\'><div class=\'text-xl font-black text-slate-900\'>45 MINS</div><div class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500 tracking-tighter\'>Avg. Response</div></div><div class=\'text-center\'><div class=\'text-xl font-black text-slate-900\'>#HVAC-9823</div><div class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500 tracking-tighter\'>Licensed / Insured</div></div></div><div class=\'flex gap-4 items-center\'><div class=\'text-right\'><div class=\'text-sm font-black text-slate-900\'>TRUSTED PARTNER</div><div class=\'text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase\'>Carrier \342\200\242 Trane \342\200\242 Rheem</div></div><div class=\'h-8 w-px bg-slate-300\'></div><div class=\'text-2xl opacity-40 grayscale\'>\342\235\204\357\270\217\360\237\224\245\342\232\241</div></div></footer></div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Bold Typography\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bold Typography\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-slate-50 flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden text-slate-900\'><div class=\'bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 py-2 px-10 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\'><div><span class=\'bg-orange-500 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm mr-2\'>Live Dispatch</span>Technicians available in your area today</div><div>24/7 Emergency Service: (555) 019-2834</div></div><header class=\'bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-5 px-10 flex justify-between items-center\'><div class=\'text-2xl font-black flex items-center gap-2\'>\342\235\204\357\270\217 APEX <span class=\'text-sky-600\'>AIR</span></div><div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'><a href=\'tel:5550192834\' class=\'text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\'>(555) 019-2834</a><button class=\'bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-md font-extrabold shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/20\'>BOOK ONLINE</button></div></header><main class=\'flex-1 grid gri