    response: "You have two easy ways to download the files for this landing page:\n\n---\n\n### Option 1: Download the Complete Project as a ZIP File (or export to GitHub)\n1. Look at the **top right corner** of the AI Studio interface.\n2. Click the **Settings / Menu** icon (or three dots `...` / Project Settings).\n3. Select **\"Export as ZIP\"** or **\"Export to GitHub\"**.\n4. This will download the entire full source code, components, styling, and configuration to your computer.\n\n---\n\n### Option 2: 1-Click Download as a Standalone `index.html` File (Ready for GHL or Any Web Host)\nI added a direct **\"Download .HTML File\"** button right inside the page:\n1. In the top navigation bar of the preview, click the **\"Get GoHighLevel Code\"** button.\n2. In the modal popup, click the orange **\"Download .HTML File\"** button.\n3. This instantly downloads a complete, self-contained `apex-air-landing-page.html` file to your computer that you can double-click to open in any browser or upload directly to any website/funnel builder."
    modified_response: "You have two easy ways to download the files for this landing page:\n\n---\n\n### Option 1: Download the Complete Project as a ZIP File (or export to GitHub)\n1. Look at the **top right corner** of the AI Studio interface.\n2. Click the **Settings / Menu** icon (or three dots `...` / Project Settings).\n3. Select **\"Export as ZIP\"** or **\"Export to GitHub\"**.\n4. This will download the entire full source code, components, styling, and configuration to your computer.\n\n---\n\n### Option 2: 1-Click Download as a Standalone `index.html` File (Ready for GHL or Any Web Host)\nI added a direct **\"Download .HTML File\"** button right inside the page:\n1. In the top navigation bar of the preview, click the **\"Get GoHighLevel Code\"** button.\n2. In the modal popup, click the orange **\"Download .HTML File\"** button.\n3. This instantly downloads a complete, self-contained `apex-air-landing-page.html` file to your computer that you can double-click to open in any browser or upload directly to any website/funnel builder."
